---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Medical Disclaimer | Real BMI"
    description="Important medical disclaimer for Real BMI users. Our health calculators provide educational estimates and do not replace professional medical advice."
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
      title="Medical Disclaimer"
      eyebrow="Important health notice"
      description="Understand how Real BMI provides educational health estimates and why you should consult a qualified professional for medical decisions."
      returnUrl="/en/"
      returnLabel="Home"
    >
      <div class="space-y-8 prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed text-lg md:text-xl font-medium opacity-90">
        <p>The information, computational tools, and health metrics provided by <strong>Real BMI</strong> are intended strictly for educational, informational, and personal awareness purposes. They do not constitute, and should never be interpreted as, professional medical advice, formal clinical diagnosis, or a personalized healthcare treatment plan.</p>

        <h2>Educational Scope & Non-Diagnostic Purpose</h2>
        <p>Our calculators generate mathematical estimates based on widely published scientific formulas and international public health guidelines, including those established by the World Health Organization (WHO) and the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC). These algorithms are designed for statistical reference across general adult populations and cannot account for your unique biological, physiological, or medical history.</p>

        <h2>Not a Substitute for Professional Healthcare</h2>
        <p>You should not use the scores, classifications, or estimates generated by Real BMI to self-diagnose health conditions, discontinue prescribed medications, or initiate drastic dietary or fitness interventions without prior medical clearance. Always consult a licensed physician, registered dietitian, or qualified healthcare provider regarding any health concerns, underlying conditions, or changes to your nutrition and physical activity regimens.</p>

        <h2>Known Limitations of Screening Metrics</h2>
        <p>Standard anthropometric screening tools, including traditional Body Mass Index (BMI), possess recognized clinical limitations. BMI evaluates total body weight relative to stature squared, but cannot differentiate between lean skeletal muscle mass, bone density, and visceral adipose tissue. High-performance athletes, older adults experiencing age-related sarcopenia, pregnant or lactating women, and individuals of diverse ethnic ancestries may exhibit scores that do not accurately represent their individual cardiometabolic risk profiles.</p>

        <h2>Emergency Situations & Acute Symptoms</h2>
        <p>Real BMI is not designed for urgent clinical care. If you are experiencing acute medical symptoms, chest pain, severe shortness of breath, sudden dizziness, or any life-threatening emergency, immediately call your local emergency emergency services (such as 911 or 112) or proceed to the nearest hospital emergency department.</p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability & User Discretion</h2>
        <p>Neither Real BMI, its creators, nor any contributing authors assume any legal liability or responsibility for decisions, actions, dietary choices, or health outcomes resulting directly or indirectly from the use of our calculators or website content. By using Real BMI, you acknowledge and agree that your engagement with our calculators is undertaken voluntarily and at your own sole discretion.</p>
      </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
